   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "full fine-tune of Qwen3.5-4B on the same 4 GPUs\n     (SGLang memory released while training)\npolicy loss: PPO clip, ε_low 0.2 / ε_high 0.28\n     + TIS (truncated importance sampling): corrects the\n        SGLang-vs-FSDP logprob mismatch\nKL to the reference model: logged, coefficient 0\nAdam, lr 1e-6; 1 optimizer step per rollout\n     (global batch 128 = the whole rollout: on-policy)",
   "originalText": "full fine-tune of Qwen3.5-4B on the same 4 GPUs\n     (SGLang memory released while training)\npolicy loss: PPO clip, ε_low 0.2 / ε_high 0.28\n     + TIS (truncated importance sampling): corrects the\n        SGLang-vs-FSDP logprob mismatch\nKL to the reference model: logged, coefficient 0\nAdam, lr 1e-6; 1 optimizer step per rollout\n     (global batch 128 = the whole rollout: on-policy)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
